@startuml sm-publication
!theme plain
skinparam stateFontSize 12

title Machine à états — Publication (Daily Verse / Special Announcement)

[*] --> DRAFT : create(...)

DRAFT --> SCHEDULED : schedule(publishDate)\n[date future]
DRAFT --> PUBLISHED : publish()\n[publication immédiate]

SCHEDULED --> PUBLISHED : trigger\n[cron à publishDate]
SCHEDULED --> RETRACTED : retract()\n[avant publication]

PUBLISHED --> RETRACTED : retract()\n[publication annulée]

RETRACTED --> [*]
PUBLISHED --> [*] : (lecture seule)

note right of SCHEDULED
  Le scheduler bbcms-core
  bascule automatiquement
  SCHEDULED → PUBLISHED
  à publishDate et publie
  l'événement
  DAILY_VERSE_PUBLISHED.
end note

note right of RETRACTED
  La publication est masquée
  côté clients ; les notifications
  push déjà envoyées ne sont
  pas rappelées.
end note

@enduml
